@startuml
participant "Secure\nStorage" as PKCS11
participant "Security\nManager" as TR181
participant "USP\nAgent" as OBUSPA
participant "Provisioning\nController" as ProvController
participant "Certificate\nAuthority" as CA
participant "USP\nController" as USPController

OBUSPA -> OBUSPA: Load provisioning\ncert in SSL context
OBUSPA -> ProvController: Connect
ProvController -> OBUSPA: Device.Security.CreateCSR()

OBUSPA -> TR181: Generate_KeyPair()
TR181 -> PKCS11: Initialize_PIN()
TR181 -> PKCS11: Generate_KeyPair()

OBUSPA -> ProvController: Device.Security.CSRCreated!(CommandKey: <CommandKey>\nName: <name>\nEncodedCSR: <CSR data>)
note right: CommandKey is {{empty}} for\nauto-update renewals.\nName identifies the certificate\nto replace in AddCertificate().
ProvController -> CA: Sign CSR / Certificate
CA --> ProvController: Sign Complete

ProvController -> OBUSPA: Device.Security.AddCertificate(Name: <name>\nMatchToCSR: true)
OBUSPA -> OBUSPA: Load new Certificate
OBUSPA -> USPController: Connect

@enduml
